Decision entries waiting for the decisions log: one Markdown file per
pull request (for example docs/decisions.d/welch-default.md), holding one
entry exactly as it will read in docs/decisions.md, starting with its
heading: "## 2026-11-18 · Title". After each merge, scripts/after-merge.R
adds the waiting entries to the end of decisions.md, oldest first, and
deletes the files, so parallel pull requests never edit the same lines.
To change an entry already in decisions.md, edit it there.
docs/adding-a-test.md, "Change notes and version numbers", has the rules.
